  "slug": "candy-apple-salad",
  "name": "Candy Apple Salad",
  "recipe_type": "salad",
  "brief_description": "My grandmother gave me this recipe earlier today. I am not crazy about Apples, but loved this salad. I told my husband to hurry up and eat it before I eat too much. My grandmother told me it is like the candy apples at a fair, which I also am not crazy about, but this was the best salad ever! Hope you all enjoy.",
  "cuisine": null,
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "In a saucepan over medium heat, stir together the egg, flour, sugar, vinegar and pineapple. Cook until thick, about 6 minutes. Set aside until completely cool."
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "text": "In a large serving bowl, fold together the pineapple mixture and whipped topping. Carefully mix in the apples and 1/2 cup of peanuts. Sprinkle the remaining nuts on the top."
    }
  ],
  "servings": 8,
  "cooking_time_minutes": 6,
